      en: ["The Our River has a total length of 96 kilometers.", "The river forms the entire state border between Luxembourg and Germany north of the Sûre.", "The rare freshwater pearl mussel (Margaritifera margaritifera) lives in the Our.", "The Vianden pumped-storage plant uses Our water for peak-load power generation.", "The Our valley is part of the cross-border Our Nature Park.", "Vianden is the most famous town on the Luxembourgish bank of the river."],
