      en: ["The total length of the Wiltz is approximately 42 kilometers.", "It originates south of Bastogne in Belgium.", "The river joins the Sauer at Goebelsmühle.", "The Wiltz is the main river of the Luxembourgish Ösling.", "The Clerve is the most significant tributary of the Wiltz.", "The elevation drop from source to mouth is about 250 meters."],
