      en: ["Houses a nature conservation center in the former Katzenberg mine.", "Part of the Minett UNESCO Biosphere in southern Luxembourg.", "The area includes restored industrial buildings from the mining era.", "Former open-cast mines evolved into valuable wetland biotopes.", "Ellergronn is part of the European Natura 2000 network.", "Hiking trails connect the site with the city of Esch-sur-Alzette."],
