      en: ["The Mamer River rises at Hivange and flows into the Alzette after 25 kilometers.", "The remains of the Roman site 'Mamer-Huerewee' are located in the valley.", "The nature reserve is part of the larger 'Kopstal-Mersch' protection network.", "The valley's sandstone formed about 200 million years ago during the Lias period.", "Rare ferns such as the hart's-tongue fern can be found in the rock crevices.", "A regional hiking trail, 'Autopédestre Kopstal', leads through the core area."],
